### Configuración de Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/products
@authUrl = http://localhost:3000/auth

### 1. Login como admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@utn.edu",
  "password": "adminSecurePassword"
}

###

@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 2. Listar catálogo (público, sin token)
GET {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Crear producto (requiere token de admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "category_id": null,
    "brand": "Xiaomi",
    "model": "Redmi Note 18",
    "description": "Smartphone gama media, 512GB",
    "price": 800000,
    "stock": 25,
    "image_url": "https://ejemplo.com/redmi-note-18.jpg"
}

###

### 4. Intentar crear producto SIN token (debe dar 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "brand": "Hacker",
    "model": "Intento sin token",
    "description": "No debería crearse",
    "price": 1,
    "stock": 1
}

###

### 5. Eliminar producto (requiere token de admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/4
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 6. Intentar eliminar SIN token (debe dar 401)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/4
Content-Type: application/json